{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2022-06-08 15:22:00', 'title': 'WALMART NAMES FINALISTS TO PITCH AT 2022 OPEN CALL EVENT, MARKING THE LARGEST GROUP EVER SELECTED', 'text': "BENTONVILLE, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALMART HAS MADE ITS SELECTIONS FOR THE NINTH ANNUAL OPEN CALL EVENT. WITH NEARLY 1,200 SMALL AND MID-SIZED BUSINESS OWNERS RECEIVING OFFICIAL INVITATIONS, THIS YEAR'S REGISTRANTS MARK THE LARGEST GROUP EVER SELECTED TO PARTICIPATE IN THE TWO-DAY EVENT. FINALISTS REPRESENT ALL FIFTY (50) STATES, INCLUDING THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA, WITH NEARLY SIXTY PERCENT (60%) OF THEM SELF-IDENTIFYING AS A DIVERSE-OWNED BUSINESS. THE BUSINESS OWNERS HAVE THE OPTION OF PITCH"}